            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "GenerateEmail"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATEEMAIL",
          "id": "1768134900330",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768134900332_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "---\nUsing the data in {{$context.$nodes.GETCONTACTSINFO.$output.result}}, generate an HTML rich text “email” communication suggestion based on the following logic:\n\n**If `RequisitionNumber` is present in {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY_DETAILS.$output.output}}:**\n\n- **Title:** Contact Hiring Team\n- **Subject:** One-line request for more details about the job, using the job title from the `Title` property in {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY_DETAILS.$output.output}}.\n- **Content:** Write in first person, stating you are reaching out for additional job details. Include a placeholder for questions.\n- **To:** Recruiter email ID  \n- **CC:** Hiring manager email ID  \n- **Signature:** On a new line, add the sender’s name from {{$context.$app.$OraUserContext.fullName}}.\n\n**If `GigNumber` is present in {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY_DETAILS.$output.output}}:**\n\n- **Title:** Contact Hiring Team\n- **Subject:** One-line request for more details about the gig opportunity, using the gig title from the `Title` property.\n- **Content:** Write in first person, stating you are reaching out for additional details about the gig opportunity. Include a placeholder for questions.\n- **To:** Gig manager email ID  \n- Leave the CC field as blank\n- **Signature:** On a new line, add the sender’s name from {{$context.$app.$OraUserContext.fullName}}.\n\n**General Instructions:**  \n- Output must be in HTML rich text format.  \n- Do not include any explanations, thinking process, or follow-up questions.\n\n---"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Summary"
